   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Development and Sanitation Program II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROVIDE SUPPORT TO THE COUNTRY&apos;S REGIONAL AND MUNICIPAL DEVELOPMENT STRATEGY IN ORDER TO IMPROVE THE QUALITY OF LIFE AMONG THE TARGET POPULATION, CHANNELING RESOURCES TO FINANCE INVESTMENT PROJECTS WHICH RESPOND TO LOCAL AND MUNICIPAL NEEDS, AND WHICH ARE COMPATIBLE WITH THE PRIORITIES AND RESOURCE AVAILABILITY AT THE NATIONAL AND REGIONAL LEVELS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
